/* =========================================================================
   FOUNTAIN SCREENPLAY TEMPLATE
   This file demonstrates proper formatting for scenes, dialogue, and cues.
   ========================================================================= */

EXT. DELTA RIVERBANK - DAWN

Dense fog blankets the silt-heavy water. A lone, rusted wooden ferry IDLES near a crumbling embankment. 

TARIQ (40s), gaunt, his long-sleeve cotton shirt stained with dark sweat halos, tests the depth of the water with a cracked bamboo pole.

TARIQ
(under his breath)
Three centimeters higher than yesterday.

Behind him, NAILA (16) adjusts a waterproof tarp covering two wicker cages of seed grain.

NAILA
Will the dike hold past noon?

TARIQ
If the sluice gate in town stays clear. Grab the line.

A low, resonant RUMBLE echoes downstream. Tariq freezes.

INT. SHACK - CONTINUOUS

Water seeps through the cracks between the bamboo floor slats. A brass kettle rattles on an unlit kerosene burner.

SMASH CUT TO:

EXT. EMBANKMENT - SECONDS LATER

The earthen dike FRACTURES. A jet of grey, muddy foam erupts through the fissure.

NAILA
Father!

Tariq drops the bamboo pole. It vanishes instantly into the swirling eddy.

FADE OUT.
